{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"印度尼西亚","country_iso":"IDN","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:54:42.202730","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"IDN-HB-0016","ldc":"No","location":"巴淡岛","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"印尼淡岛240MW光伏+绿色合成氨项目","project_name_en":"Indonesia Batam Island 240MW PV + Green Ammonia Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"能建国际集团","content":"近日，中国能建中电工程国际公司与东北院联合体成功签约印尼淡岛绿色合成氨可再生能源项目EPC合同\n。项目位于印尼巴淡岛，计划建设总装机240兆瓦的陆地光伏与水面光伏发电站。以及年产3.75万吨绿色合成氨设施。\n这是中国能建绿电氢氨醇先进技术在东南亚首个落地的项目，将提供包括技术方案设计、设备供应、工程建设及运营管理在内的一体化解决方案，确保项目的高效实施与长期稳定运营。其生产的绿色合成氨将输送至新加波。项目将成为中国能建助力东南亚区域能源转型，优化能源结构的重要支撑点，为当地绿色低碳转型注入强劲动力。","content_sha256":"3e75e83107d33d6ea4ba8e8fcda9aa6a0f047accd76dff43d231e8b899413cba","id":4234,"publish_date":"2025-04-01 06:25:53","title":"中国能建中电工程国际公司与东北院联合体签约首个东南亚绿电氢氨醇项目","title_sha256":"caeae47bf2b8625eacd5d7f5061bc9f6869c9817ac5fa8c31f70454232596d6a","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/80831.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"IDN-HB-0016","capacity_details":"PV: 240MW","capacity_mw":240.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"240","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:54:42.202869","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"IDN-HB-0016-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://www.ceec.net.cn/art/2025/4/8/art_11019_2534910.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"中国能建中电工程国际公司与东北院联合体","project_developer_en":"China Energy Engineering Corporation International Company and Northeast Electric Power Design Institute formed a consortium","project_sta